pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  骑行热力页。左图是全天 24 小时分时曲线，早 8 点与晚 6 点两座峰一目了然；右图把工作日与周末拆成四个时段对比——周末没有早高峰，但午间和夜间反而更热。解读要点：双峰（7-9 时、17-19 时）合计约 351/705 ≈ 全天 50% 的订单量，分时指数是把全天订单归一为 705 后的分布指数。
elements:
  - elementId: masthead-name
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 24, 420, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 两轮城市研究院 · URBAN CYCLING ANNUAL

  - elementId: masthead-folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 24, 340, 18]
    content:
      style: "$masthead"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: VOL.2025 · No.03 / 07

  - elementId: masthead-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 48, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$text" }

  - elementId: ch-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 66, 80, 56]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 44
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: "02"

  - elementId: page-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 72, 500, 18]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 骑行热力 · RHYTHM OF THE DAY

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 92, 750, 38]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 清晨八点与傍晚六点，城市在两轮上完成两次心跳

  - elementId: chart1-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 158, 500, 20]
    content:
      style: "$h3"
      fontSize: 13
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 24 小时分时骑行指数（全天合计 = 705）

  - elementId: heat-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [60, 184, 500, 236]
    fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
    legend: false
    data:
      cols: [hour, idx]
      rows:
        - ["0时", 4]
        - ["1时", 2]
        - ["2时", 1]
        - ["3时", 1]
        - ["4时", 2]
        - ["5时", 5]
        - ["6时", 12]
        - ["7时", 38]
        - ["8时", 72]
        - ["9时", 55]
        - ["10时", 36]
        - ["11时", 32]
        - ["12时", 36]
        - ["13时", 33]
        - ["14时", 30]
        - ["15时", 31]
        - ["16时", 34]
        - ["17时", 48]
        - ["18时", 78]
        - ["19时", 60]
        - ["20时", 40]
        - ["21时", 28]
        - ["22时", 18]
        - ["23时", 9]
    xAxis:
      label: { fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
      axisLine: { color: "$text", width: 1 }
      gridLine: false
    yAxis:
      min: 0
      max: 80
      label: { fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
      gridLine: { color: "$gridline", width: 0.75 }
    series:
      - type: area
        encode: { x: hour, y: idx }
        name: 骑行指数
        smooth: true
        width: 2.5
        lineColor: "$primary"
        areaColor: "#16324F24"

  - elementId: chart1-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 428, 500, 56]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>早晚高峰（7-9 时、17-19 时）合计贡献全天约 <span style="color:$accent;"><strong>50%</strong></span> 的订单；最高峰不在清晨，而在 <span style="color:$accent;"><strong>18 时</strong></span>——下班的路比上班更依赖两轮。</p>

  - elementId: chart-sep
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [582, 164, 1, 320]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: chart2-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [606, 158, 294, 20]
    content:
      style: "$h3"
      fontSize: 13
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 工作日 vs 周末 · 分时段订单指数

  - elementId: weekend-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [606, 184, 294, 236]
    fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
    barWidth: 0.62
    data:
      cols: [slot, weekday, weekend]
      rows:
        - ["早高峰", 100, 42]
        - ["午间", 46, 68]
        - ["晚高峰", 94, 76]
        - ["夜间", 38, 61]
    legend: { position: bottom, fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
    xAxis:
      label: { fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
      axisLine: { color: "$text", width: 1 }
      gridLine: false
    yAxis:
      label: { fontSize: 10.5, color: "$muted" }
      gridLine: { color: "$gridline", width: 0.75 }
    series:
      - type: bar
        encode: { x: slot, y: weekday }
        name: 工作日
        fill: "$primary"
      - type: bar
        encode: { x: slot, y: weekend }
        name: 周末
        fill: "$accent"

  - elementId: chart2-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [606, 428, 294, 56]
    content:
      style: "$serif-note"
      align: [left, top]
      text: 数据注记：周末没有早高峰，但午间被休闲骑行填满——两轮在休息日换了一种角色。

  - elementId: source-line
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 510, 700, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 数据来源：两轮城市研究院 · 2025 城市骑行监测样本（虚构演示数据）· 指数口径：工作日早高峰 = 100
